          "type": "text",
          "text": "Email"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Hi Ryan and team,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "As Matthew mentioned, Lawan and I have been working closely to push through the final elements of your website refresh. We're excited about the progress and wanted to provide you with a comprehensive update on where we stand and our path to completion."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Current Status & Next Steps"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Over the next few days, we will be wrapping up the remaining tasks from our [project tracking sheet](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1TnhYY8gBzXrygVaQNZKbQkyVDh_ia7NuipW1QtLK4WE/edit?gid=198727663#gid=198727663), and the **membership system integration is our primary focus**, which represents the last major hurdle before launch."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Membership Platform Recommendation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "After beginning development on a custom solution, we've determined it would be more efficient and reliable to leverage a proven third-party platform. I strongly recommend **Memberstack**. It is the most popular and well-documented Webflow integration, and has a free plan that is more than enough for your needs. Here are the details:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Memberstack Basic Plan:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Price:** $29/month"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Transaction Fee:** 4%"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Features:**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Support for 1,000 members"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Social logins"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Stripe payment integration"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Custom SSO capabilities"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Branded email communications"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Comprehensive Webflow integration (industry leading)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "To sign up for the Basic plan, please use the following link: [Memberstack Basic Plan](https://memberstack.com/pricing)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Once this is setup, please provide me with the login credentials so I can begin the migration process."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Timeline & Next Steps"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Next Week:** I'd love to schedule time to walk through the completed site with your team and address any final tweaks or adjustments."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Action Items:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Please review the membership platform options and let me know your preference"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. If you choose Memberstack, I can assist with the initial setup"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Let's coordinate a review session for next week (avoiding Thursday 6/26 per your note)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Thank you for your patience as we work through these final elements. It's really coming together and I'm excited to go live very soon!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
